+    Actually, the standard compact formula often cited as "correct" in GLSL libraries (like [S9, unofficial]) is:
+    $$ d(p) = \text{length}(\max(q, 0)) + \min(\max(q_x, \max(q_y, q_z)), 0) $$
+    Let's verify this compact formula.
